# Uploaded catch photos, at the repository root only. NOT anchored, this
# pattern matched any directory named `media` at any depth - and silently
# swallowed the whole `app/media/` package, which then failed only in CI on a
# fresh clone. The leading slash is the entire fix.
/media/
